{"unit_id":"tag:0GJA:statement","translation":"在情形<REF_0001>中，假设<MATH_0001>可构造（constructible）。设<MATH_0002>是一个稠密（dense）开子概形（open subscheme）的包含映射（inclusion）。那么，陈述（<REF_0002>）至（<REF_0003>）对于<MATH_0003>成立，当且仅当它们对于<MATH_0004>成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"dense","target_term":"稠密"},{"source_term":"open subscheme","target_term":"开子概形"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"系数层假设"},{"source_term":"dense","target_term":"稠密","context":"开子概形的性质"},{"source_term":"open subscheme","target_term":"开子概形","context":"限制的对象"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含映射","context":"开子概形的态射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GJA:proof","translation":"由于<MATH_0001>稠密（dense），可见<MATH_0002>的维数（dimension）为<MATH_0003>，因此它是一个有限集（finite set）<MATH_0004>，由<MATH_0005>有理点（-rational points）组成。考虑引理<REF_0001>中的短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0006>\n。注意<MATH_0007>。具体而言，<MATH_0008>是闭浸入（closed immersion），因此有限（finite），于是由命题<REF_0002>，<MATH_0009>对于<MATH_0010>消失，因此所述等式（equality）由 Leray 谱序列（spectral sequence）（《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》，引理<REF_0003>）得到。由于<MATH_0011>是代数闭（algebraically closed）域（fields）的谱（spectra）的不交并（disjoint union），得出<MATH_0012>对于<MATH_0013>成立，并且\n<MATH_0014>\n是有限（finite）的，因为<MATH_0015>有限（finite），这是由<MATH_0016>可构造（constructible）的假设得到的。长正合上同调（cohomology）列（sequence）给出正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0017>\n，以及对于<MATH_0019>成立的同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0018>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n此时容易推出：（<REF_0004>）至（<REF_0005>）中的每一条对于<MATH_0020>成立，当且仅当它对于<MATH_0021>成立。我们给出几条简短（small）的注记以帮助读者：(a) 若<MATH_0022>具有与<MATH_0023>的特征（characteristic）互素（prime to）的挠（torsion），则<MATH_0024>也如此，(b) 层（sheaf）<MATH_0025>可构造（constructible），(c) 有<MATH_0026>，以及 (d) 若<MATH_0027>是开集（open），则<MATH_0028>在<MATH_0029>中稠密（dense）。\n","allowed_english":["Leray","a","b","c","d"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"dense","target_term":"稠密"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集"},{"source_term":"-rational points","target_term":"有理点"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"equality","target_term":"等式"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"constructible","target