{"unit_id":"tag:03SG:proof","translation":"由于<MATH_0001>光滑（smooth），它是光滑（smooth）曲线（curves）的不交并（disjoint union），因此可假设<MATH_0002>是一条曲线（curve）（即不可约（irreducible））。此时，要么<MATH_0003>，无需证明任何事；要么<MATH_0004>稠密（dense）。后一情形中，引理由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"curves","target_term":"曲线"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"curve","target_term":"曲线"},{"source_term":"irreducible","target_term":"不可约"},{"source_term":"dense","target_term":"稠密"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"概形与曲线性质"},{"source_term":"curves","target_term":"曲线","context":"分支"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并","context":"分支分解"},{"source_term":"curve","target_term":"曲线","context":"归约情形"},{"source_term":"irreducible","target_term":"不可约","context":"曲线性质"},{"source_term":"dense","target_term":"稠密","context":"开集性质"}],"notes":[]}
